征值λ1 = 1,λ2 =-1, 对应的特征向量为α1,α2,k 为任意常数, 则下列选项中正确\n的是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"kα1 必是A 的特征向量 B. α1 - α2 必是A 的特征向量","C":"α1 + α2 必是A 的特征向量 D. α1 + α2 必是A2 的特征向量"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-mcq-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-mcq-5.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["eigen_prop"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-mcq-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":6,"pdf_page":186,"stem":"设A 是3 阶实对称矩阵, α = -1,1,1 T 满足A-2E α = 0, 且r A = 1.k1,k2 为任意常数, 则方程\n组AX = 0 的通解为( ).\nT + k2 1,-1,0 T T + k2 1,0,1 T","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"k1 1,1,0 B. k1 1,1,0T + k2 1,1,1 T T + k2 1,0,-1 T","C":"k1 1,1,0 D. k1 1,1,0"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-mcq-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-mcq-6.jpg","answer":"B","facets":["real_sym","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-mcq-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":7,"pdf_page":187,"stem":"设3 维列向量α1,α2,α3 线性无关，A = aij 3×3 满足Aα1 = α1,Aα2 = α2 + α3,Aα3 = α1 + α3,Aij 是\naij 的代数余子式, 则A11 + A22 + A33 = ( ).","kp_ids":["la.eig.value","la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"1","B":"2","C":"3","D":"4"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-mcq-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-mcq-7.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["eigen_prop","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-mcq-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":8,"pdf_page":187,"stem":"设A,B,C 均为3 阶矩阵，r C = 1，r B = 2，且满足A+E C = O,B AT-2E = O，则下列矩\n阵中与A 相似的是( ).\n2 1 0 -1 1 0 -2 0 0 -1 0 0","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.similar"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"0 2 1","B":"0 -1 1","C":"0 -2 0"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-mcq-8.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-mcq-8.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["diagonalize","similar"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-mcq-9","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":9,"pdf_page":187,"stem":"设两个不相等的3 阶矩阵A,B 满足A-B ).","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"A - B 是对角矩阵 B. A - B 只有一个线性无关的特征向量","C":"A - B 有两个线性无关的特征向量 D. A - B 有三个线性无关的特征向量"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-mcq-9.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-mcq-9.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["eigen_prop"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-mcq-10","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":10,"pdf_page":188,"stem":"设A 为2 阶实矩阵, α 与β 是A 的两个单位实特征向量, 且满足||α + β|| = ||α - β||, 则( ).","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"r A = 1 B. r A = 2","C":"A 必相似于对角矩阵 D. A 必与单位矩阵合同"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-mcq-10.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-mcq-10.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-fill-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":1,"pdf_page":188,"stem":"设A 是3 阶方阵, α 为3 维列向量，P = α,Aα,A2α 为可逆矩阵, B = P-1AP，且A3α + 2A2α =\n3Aα，则A+E = _____.","kp_ids":["la.eig.value","la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-fill-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-fill-1.jpg","facets":["eigen_prop","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-fill-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":2,"pdf_page":188,"stem":"设A3×3 是秩为1 的实对称矩阵，λ1 = 2 是A 的一个特征值，对应的特征向量为α1 = -1,1,1 T，\n则方程组Ax = 0 的基础解系为_____.\nk","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-fill-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-fill-2.jpg","facets":["real_sym","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-fill-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":3,"pdf_page":189,"stem":"设α1,α2, ⋯,αk k>1 是n 维正交单位实列向量组, A = αi αT i ,E 是n 阶单位矩阵, 则行列式\ni=1\nA+E * = _____.","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-fill-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-fill-3.jpg","facets":["eigen_prop","real_sym"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":1,"pdf_page":189,"stem":"已知A = α1,α2,α3 是3 阶可逆矩阵, B 是3 阶矩阵, 且BA = α1,-4α3,-α2 .求:\n(I)B 的全部特征值;\n(II) 可逆矩阵P 和对角矩阵Λ, 使得P-1BP = Λ.","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-1.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":2,"pdf_page":190,"stem":"设A 是n n≥2 阶矩阵，α1,α2, ⋯,αn 是n 维列向量，且Aα1 = α2,Aα2 = α3, ⋯,Aαn-1 = αn，Aαn\n= 0,αn ≠0.\n(I) 证明:α1,α2, ⋯,αn 线性无关;\n(II) 求可逆矩阵P 及三角矩阵B, 使得P-1AP = B.","kp_ids":["la.eig.similar","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-2.jpg","facets":["similar","eigen_compute","jordan"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":3,"pdf_page":190,"stem":"设A 是3 阶矩阵，α1,α2，α3 是3 维列向量，且α1 ≠0，Aα1 = kα1，Aα2 = α1 + kα2，Aα3 = α2 +\nkα3.\n(I) 证明:α1,α2,α3 是R3 的一组基;\n(II) 若Aα1,Aα2,Aα3 线性相关，求r A 及tr A .","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-3.jpg","facets":["eigen_prop","similar","jordan"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-4","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":4,"pdf_page":191,"stem":"设α1 是3 阶矩阵A 的属于特征值λ λ≠0 的特征向量,3 维列向量α2,α3 满足\nλE-A α2 = α1, λE-A α3 = α2.\n(I) 证明:α1,α2,α3 线性无关;\n(II) 计算行列式A+A* , 其中A*是A 的伴随矩阵.","kp_ids":["la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-4.jpg","facets":["eigen_prop","jordan"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":5,"pdf_page":191,"stem":"设A3×3 有三个不同的特征值λ1,λ2,λ3, 它们对应的特征向量分别为α1,α2,α3, 令β = α1 + α2 + α3.\n(I) 证明:β,Aβ,A2β 线性无关;\n(II) 若A3β = Aβ, 求r A-E .\nT,β = b1,b2,⋯,bn T 均为非零列向量, A = αβT.","kp_ids":["la.eig.value","la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-5.jpg","facets":["eigen_prop","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":6,"pdf_page":192,"stem":"设α = a1,a2,⋯,an\n(I) 求A 的全部特征值;\n(II) 问αTβ 满足什么条件时, A 可以相似于对角矩阵Λ, 并求可逆矩阵P, 使P-1AP = Λ.\na 1 1 ⋯ 1\n1 a 1 ⋯ 1","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-6.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":7,"pdf_page":192,"stem":"设n n>2 阶矩阵A = 1 1 a ⋯ 1 .求:\n⋮ ⋮ ⋮ ⋮\n1 1 1 ⋯ a\n(I) 可逆矩阵P 及对角矩阵Λ, 使得P-1AP = Λ;\n(II)r A* .","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-7.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","real_sym","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":8,"pdf_page":193,"stem":"设A 是2 阶矩阵, α 是非零向量, 且α 不是A 的特征向量.\n(I) 证明:α,Aα 线性无关;\n(II) 记P = α,Aα , 若A2α - 2Aα = 8α, 证明:A 相似于对角矩阵, 并求P-1AP.","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-8.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-8.jpg","facets":["diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-9","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":9,"pdf_page":193,"stem":"设α,β 为3 维单位列向量, 且αTβ = 0, 记A = αβT + βαT.\n(I) 证明:A 相似于对角矩阵;\n(II) 若存在3 维列向量γ ≠0, 使得Aγ = 0, 记P = γ,2 α+β ,β-α , 求P-1AP.\n1 a12 a13 1 2a12 2a13","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-9.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-9.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","real_sym"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-10","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":10,"pdf_page":194,"stem":"设A = 1 a22 a23 可逆, B 是3 阶实对称矩阵, 且满足BA = 1 2a22 2a23 .求:\n1 a32 a33 1 2a32 2a33\n(I)B 的特征值和对应的特征向量;\n(II) 正交矩阵Q，使得QTBQ = Λ.","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-10.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-10.jpg","facets":["real_sym","diagonalize","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-11","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":11,"pdf_page":195,"stem":"设向量组I α1 = -a,0,1 T,α2 = 1-a,a,1-a T,α3 = 1,0,-a T, II β1 = -1,0,a T,\nT,β3 = 1,-1,-a T a≠0\nβ2 = -1,1,a , 向量组(I) 与(II) 等价.\n(I) 求a 的值;\n(II) 记A = α1,α2,α3 , 问当a 为何值时, 存在正交矩阵Q, 使得Q-1AQ = Λ? 并求Q 及Λ.\na 0 1 -1 1 0 1","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-11.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-11.jpg","facets":["real_sym","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-12","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":12,"pdf_page":196,"stem":"设A = 0 -a 0 ,B = 1 -1 0 ,β = 1 ,a ≠0.若方程组AX = β 有无穷多解.\n1 0 a 0 0 -a a\n(I) 求a 的值, 并求方程组AX = β 的全部解;\n(II) 当a 为何值时, 存在正交矩阵Q, 使得Q-1AQ = B? 并求正交矩阵Q.","kp_ids":["la.eig.similar","la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-12.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-12.jpg","facets":["similar","real_sym","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-13","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":13,"pdf_page":197,"stem":"设A,B 均是n 阶矩阵.\n(I) 证明:AB 与BA 有相同的特征值;\n(II) 若AB = BA, 且A 有n 个不同的特征值, 证明:B 相似于对角矩阵.\n0 2 3","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-13.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-13.jpg","facets":["eigen_prop","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-14","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":14,"pdf_page":197,"stem":"设A = 2 2 a ,3 阶实对称矩阵B 满足AB + B = A + E,B ≠E, 其中E 为单位矩阵.\n2 3 4\n(I) 求a 的值;\n(II) 求所有满足题干的矩阵B;\n(III) 求可逆矩阵P 及对角矩阵Λ, 使得P-1BP = Λ.","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-14.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-14.jpg","facets":["real_sym","diagonalize"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-15","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":15,"pdf_page":198,"stem":"设向量β = b,1,1 T 可由α1 = a,0,1 T,α2 = 1,a-1,1 T,α3 = 1,0,a T 线性表示, 且表示法不唯\n一.记A = α1,α2,α3 .求:\n(I)a,b 的值, 并写出β 由α1,α2,α3 表示的线性表达式;\n(II) 一个可逆矩阵P, 使得P-1AP = Λ(Λ 为对角矩阵).\n2 1 0 a b c","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-15.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-15.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","eigen_compute"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-16","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":16,"pdf_page":199,"stem":"设A = 1 2 0 与B = 0 1 0 相似.\n0 0 1 -1 -2 4\n(I) 求a,b,c 的值;\n(II) 求可逆矩阵P, 使得P-1AP = B;\n(III) 记A 的伴随矩阵为A*, 求方程组3E-A* X = 0 的通解.\n1 -1 0","kp_ids":["la.eig.similar","la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-16.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-16.jpg","facets":["similar","eigen_compute","eigen_prop"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-17","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":17,"pdf_page":200,"stem":"设B = 不可逆, 且满足AB = B,B* AT+E = O, 其中A 是3 阶矩阵, E 是3 阶单\n1 0 k\n-1 1 1-k\n位矩阵, B*是B 的伴随矩阵.\n(I) 求r B* ;\n(II) 证明:A 相似于对角矩阵, 并求A2.","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-17.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-17.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","eigen_prop"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-1-x2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":1,"pdf_page":201,"stem":"设A 是3 阶实对称矩阵，存在可逆矩阵P，使得P-1AP = diag 1,2,-1 ，且α1 = 1,k+1,2 T，\nα2 = k-1,-k,1 T 分别为A 的特征值λ1 = 1,λ2 = 2 对应的特征向量，A* 的特征值λ0 对应的特征向\n量β = 2,-5k,2k+1 T.求:\n(I)λ0 与k 的值;\n(II) 矩阵A-1 *.\n满足an 1 2 an-1 ∞\n1","kp_ids":["la.eig.value","la.eig.diag"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-1-x2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-1-x2.jpg","facets":["real_sym","eigen_compute","eigen_prop"]},{"id":"ll-hard-14-big-2-x2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"14","section_name":"相似矩阵","qno":2,"pdf_page":202,"stem":"设数列an ，bn = n=1,2,⋯ ,a0 = 1,b0 =-1，求级数\nbn -1 4 bn-1 an-bn\nn=0\n的和.","kp_ids":["la.eig.diag","la.eig.value"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-14-big-2-x2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-14-big-2-x2.jpg","facets":["diagonalize","eigen_compute","recurrence"]}]